      <activity id="75d442c6-da75-5a25-a8b9-fce3bc3b6a25" activityNameId="67a85cc5-e739-5a57-b351-26b11cfb6d17" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Blasting</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Blasting
All emissions are calculated based on the composition of the raw materials and completed by the report "Emissionsfaktoren für stationäre Quellen". No emissions of the blasted rock is included.  This module should not be used if its relative importance would be high in a certain environmental inventory.;
Synonyms: blasting, agent, Tovex; 
UUID: f4afe0ed-9682-35b1-8c80-43a0d8bf3898
Includes the raw material (explosive Tovex) and the emissions (calculated stoichiometric)
Location: The explosive Tovex is a CH-module and is used as proxy for RER
Technology: Blasting of 100% Tovex
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Emissions are based on stochiometric calculations and all other In- and Output modules are estimations 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f4afe0ed-9682-35b1-8c80-43a0d8bf3898.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
